                    <li>
                      <a class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"
                        href="http://wdr.ubion.co.kr/CodingExercise/form-codeeditor2_left.html" target="_blank"
                        title="학습창 실행(새창)">
                        <p class="m-0 d-inline-block w-90">
